msgid "<p>To interact with above HTML you will have to use <code>root_element</code> as a parent selector.</p><p>For example:</p><pre class=\"p-3 bg-gray-100 border-radius rounded-sm mb-0\" style=\"width: fit-content;\"><code>// here root_element is provided by default\n"
